<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγανός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watertight, waterproof</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκήματα ς. πρὸς ὕδωρ καὶ πρὸς χιόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.19.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.497.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέγη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(7).62.25
				</span></i>
			 (Amorgos, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγν᾽ ἔχων σκηνώματα</span>, of a cave, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				324
			</span></i>; of a boat, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.136
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; of embankments, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.486.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; of cisterns, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				483.194
			</span></i>, al. (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγνόν, τό</span>, <i>covered dwelling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.25
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν στεγνῷ ποιεῖσθαι τὰς
				νεοττιάς</span>
			<i>under cover</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				618a35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ς. φυλάττειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					844b13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>costive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς. περὶ κύστιν καὶ νεφροὺς πάθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεγνὰ πτερά</span> wings <i>joined by a
				membrane</i>, like those of the bat, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				762
			</span></i>.</div>
